{"unit_id":"173787247__dsh-wsl-launch#feature-1","repo":"173787247/dsh-wsl-launch","commit":"7de2c1dfd215438093a5c201d129ac595b0539bb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wsl-launch 的功能「白名单应用启动」：通过 win_launch 提交 Windows 可执行文件名或路径，并可附带参数；插件仅接受默认列表或配置列表匹配的目标，再调用 PowerShell 启动应用。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:30-47","index.js:64-74","lib/launch.js:6-15"]}
{"unit_id":"173787247__dsh-wsl-launch#feature-2","repo":"173787247/dsh-wsl-launch","commit":"7de2c1dfd215438093a5c201d129ac595b0539bb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wsl-launch 的功能「自定义白名单与超时」：插件配置可指定 allowlist 和 timeoutMs；名单为空时恢复内置应用列表，超时值无效时采用默认值 20 秒。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:13-18","lib/launch.js:18-28"]}
{"unit_id":"173787247__dsh-wsl-launch#feature-3","repo":"173787247/dsh-wsl-launch","commit":"7de2c1dfd215438093a5c201d129ac595b0539bb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wsl-launch 的功能「启动状态反馈」：调用工具后返回启动成功的目标和参数；未运行于 WSL、目标为空或不匹配白名单时返回对应错误，PowerShell 执行异常也会转成错误结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:64-82","lib/launch.js:42-46"]}
